{"id": "28be7264-83a8-435e-ba6e-55f858bdbbab", "slug": "registration-tech-summit", "title": "Registration - Tech Summit", "description": "Registration Tech Background Effect is designed for delivering a visual treatment or immersive background effect. Key features include atmospheric visuals, motion depth, and flexible presentation layering. It is suitable for visual-first pages, motion studies, and atmospheric hero treatments.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Registration - Tech Summit\"\ndescription: \"Registration Tech Background Effect is designed for delivering a visual treatment or immersive background effect. Key features include atmospheric visuals, motion depth, and flexible presentation layering. It is suitable for visual-first pages, motion studies, and atmospheric hero treatments.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#4FACFE\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#FF0080\"\n  background: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  surface: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#E5E7EB\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Geist\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"-apple-system\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"24px\"\n  control: \"22px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Registration - Tech Summit\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Sourasith Phomhome (@madebysourasith). Views: 5; favorites: 5; remixes: 2.\nTags: background, animated, webgl, threejs, dither, effect.\n## Overview\nRegistration Tech Background Effect is designed for delivering a visual treatment or immersive background effect. Key features include atmospheric visuals, motion depth, and flexible presentation layering. It is suitable for visual-first pages, motion studies, and atmospheric hero treatments.\n\nRegistration Secure Your Spot at Nexus Tech Summit Today! Admit One Pass Type General Access General Admission Access to the main stage, exhibitions, and standard networking sessions throughout the summit. Entry to keyn…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Secure Your Spot at Nexus Tech Summit Today!; General Admission.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #4FACFE, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #FF0080, background #FFFFFF, surface #FFFFFF, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Geist for display moments and -apple-system for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"scroll-smooth\"><head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Registration - Tech Summit</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <style>\n        /* Base configuration keeping typography crisp */\n        body {\n            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \"Apple Color Emoji\", \"Segoe UI Emoji\", \"Segoe UI Symbol\";\n            background-color: #030305;\n            color: #ffffff;\n            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n            -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;\n        }\n\n        /* Skeuomorphic & Custom Utilities */\n        .glass-panel {\n            background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03) 0%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.01) 100%);\n            box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05), 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\n            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);\n        }\n\n        .mesh-gradient-bg {\n            background: radial-gradient(120% 120% at 50% -10%, #3a32ff 0%, #1a157a 40%, #050314 100%);\n        }\n\n        .text-glow {\n            text-shadow: 0 0 24px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);\n        }\n\n        /* Masked Reveal CSS */\n        .reveal-wrapper {\n            overflow: hidden;\n            display: inline-block;\n            vertical-align: top;\n        }\n\n        .reveal-word {\n            display: inline-block;\n            transform: translateY(100%);\n            will-change: transform;\n        }\n\n        /* 3D Ticket CSS Approximation */\n        .ticket-container {\n            perspective: 1200px;\n            transform-style: preserve-3d;\n        }\n\n        .ticket-body {\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00f2fe 0%, #4facfe 100%);\n            box-shadow:\n                inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.4),\n                inset 0 20px 40px rgba(255,255,255,0.3),\n                inset 0 -20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.2),\n                0 20px 50px rgba(79, 172, 254, 0.3),\n                -20px 0 60px rgba(255, 0, 128, 0.15); /* Pinkish glow hint from ref */\n            transform: rotateX(15deg) rotateY(-20deg) rotateZ(-5deg);\n            transition: transform 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1);\n        }\n\n        .ticket-container:hover .ticket-body {\n            transform: rotateX(5deg) rotateY(-5deg) rotateZ(0deg);\n        }\n\n        .ticket-edge-glow {\n            background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(255,255,255,0.8), transparent);\n            filter: blur(4px);\n        }\n    </style>\n<link id=\"all-fonts-link-font-geist\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@300;400;500;600;700&amp;display=swap\"><style id=\"all-fonts-style-font-geist\">.font-geist { font-family: 'Geist', sans-serif !important; }</style></head>\n<body class=\"relative min-h-screen overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-blue-500/30\">\n\n    <!-- WebGL Background Grid -->\n    <canvas id=\"bg-canvas\" class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none opacity-60\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Container Lines (Framed Grid Layout) -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none flex justify-center px-4 md:px-8\">\n        <div class=\"w-full max-w-7xl flex justify-between relative h-full\">\n            <div class=\"w-[1px] h-full bg-white/[0.03] relative\">\n                <div class=\"absolute top-24 -left-[3px] w-1.5 h-1.5 border border-white/20 bg-[#030305]\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-24 -left-[3px] w-1.5 h-1.5 border border-white/20 bg-[#030305]\"></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"w-[1px] h-full bg-white/[0.03] hidden md:block\"></div>\n            <div class=\"w-[1px] h-full bg-white/[0.03] hidden lg:block\"></div>\n            <div class=\"w-[1px] h-full bg-white/[0.03] relative\">\n                <div class=\"absolute top-24 -left-[3px] w-1.5 h-1.5 border border-white/20 bg-[#030305]\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-24 -left-[3px] w-1.5 h-1.5 border border-white/20 bg-[#030305]\"></div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Main Content -->\n    <main class=\"relative z-10 w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pt-32 pb-24 min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-center\">\n\n        <!-- Header Section -->\n        <div class=\"mb-16 md:mb-24\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-6 opacity-80\">\n                <div class=\"w-8 h-[2px] bg-white\"></div>\n                <span class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium tracking-wide font-geist\">Registration</span>\n            </div>\n            <h1 class=\"text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl xl:text-7xl leading-[1.1] max-w-3xl gs-reveal font-geist font-light tracking-tighter\">\n                Secure Your Spot at <span class=\"text-white/40 font-geist font-light tracking-tighter\">Nexus Tech Summit Today!</span>\n            </h1>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Layout Grid -->\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-center\">\n\n            <!-- Left Graphic: 3D Ticket CSS Representation -->\n            <div class=\"lg:col-span-5 relative h-[400px] lg:h-[500px] flex items-center justify-center ticket-container\">\n                <!-- Outer abstract glow -->\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-blue-500/10 blur-[100px] rounded-full\"></div>\n\n                <!-- Ticket Shape -->\n                <div class=\"ticket-body relative w-64 sm:w-72 h-96 sm:h-[420px] rounded-[24px] p-1 flex flex-col\">\n                    <!-- Edge highlight -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-1/4 right-1/4 h-[2px] ticket-edge-glow\"></div>\n\n                    <!-- Inner Glass -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-[2px] rounded-[22px] bg-black/10 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/20 overflow-hidden\">\n                        <!-- Diagonal scanline texture -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-20\" style=\"background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, transparent, transparent 2px, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 2px, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 4px);\"></div>\n\n                        <!-- Content inside ticket -->\n                        <div class=\"relative h-full p-6 flex flex-col justify-between\">\n                            <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start opacity-70\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:qr-code-linear\" class=\"text-3xl\"></iconify-icon>\n                                <span class=\"text-[10px] tracking-widest uppercase font-medium font-geist\">Admit One</span>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <!-- Dashed line detail -->\n                            <div class=\"absolute bottom-24 left-0 right-0 flex justify-between px-6\">\n                                <div class=\"w-full border-t-2 border-dashed border-white/30\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"absolute bottom-24 left-[-10px] w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-[#030305] border border-white/20 z-10 transform translate-y-1/2\"></div>\n                            <div class=\"absolute bottom-24 right-[-10px] w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-[#030305] border border-white/20 z-10 transform translate-y-1/2\"></div>\n\n                            <div class=\"mb-4\">\n                                <div class=\"text-xs text-white/60 mb-1 font-geist\">Pass Type</div>\n                                <div class=\"text-lg font-medium tracking-tight font-geist\">General Access</div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Right Cards Container -->\n            <div class=\"lg:col-span-7 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 lg:gap-6 h-full\">\n\n                <!-- Card 1: Details -->\n                <div class=\"relative group rounded-[24px] p-[1px] overflow-hidden transition-all duration-500\">\n                    <!-- Border Gradient Layer -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-white/10 via-white/5 to-transparent\"></div>\n\n                    <!-- Inner Card -->\n                    <div class=\"relative h-full bg-[#0A0A0F] rounded-[23px] p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight mb-3 font-geist\">General Admission</h3>\n                        <p class=\"text-white/50 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-8 font-geist\">Access to the main stage, exhibitions, and standard networking sessions throughout the summit.</p>\n\n                        <ul class=\"space-y-4 mt-auto\">\n                            <li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-white/80 font-geist\">\n                                <div class=\"w-[2px] h-4 bg-blue-500/50 rounded-full mt-0.5\"></div>\n                                Entry to keynote sessions\n                            </li>\n                            <li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-white/80 font-geist\">\n                                <div class=\"w-[2px] h-4 bg-blue-500/50 rounded-full mt-0.5\"></div>\n                                Access to tech expo floor\n                            </li>\n                            <li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-white/80 font-geist\">\n                                <div class=\"w-[2px] h-4 bg-blue-500/50 rounded-full mt-0.5\"></div>\n                                Standard networking lounge\n                            </li>\n                            <li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-white/80 font-geist\">\n                                <div class=\"w-[2px] h-4 bg-blue-500/50 rounded-full mt-0.5\"></div>\n                                Summit welcome kit\n                            </li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Card 2: Pricing (Skeuomorphic & Mesh) -->\n                <div class=\"relative rounded-[24px] p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col h-full overflow-hidden mesh-gradient-bg border border-white/10 shadow-[inset_0_2px_20px_rgba(255,255,255,0.15),_0_20px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6)]\">\n\n                    <!-- Aura Asset as subtle overlay for texture -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 mix-blend-overlay opacity-20 pointer-events-none\" style=\"background-image: url('https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/e534354d-c5f2-4399-a1d9-2f50338e8c47_1600w.jpg'); background-size: cover; background-position: center;\"></div>\n\n                    <!-- Glow effect inside -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-48 h-48 bg-white/10 rounded-full blur-[60px] pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n                    <div class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col h-full\">\n                        <div>\n                            <span class=\"px-3 py-1 text-xs border border-white/20 rounded-full inline-block mb-8 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-sm font-geist\">Early Bird</span>\n\n                            <!-- Price -->\n                            <div class=\"text-6xl sm:text-7xl font-medium tracking-tight mb-2 text-glow font-geist\">$299</div>\n                            <div class=\"text-white/80 text-sm font-geist\">Single admission</div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Skeuomorphic Button -->\n                        <button class=\"mt-auto w-full group relative rounded-full bg-gradient-to-b from-white/15 to-white/5 border border-white/20 backdrop-blur-md transition-all duration-300 py-4 px-6 flex items-center justify-between shadow-[inset_0_1px_4px_rgba(255,255,255,0.3),_0_4px_12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.2)] hover:shadow-[inset_0_1px_4px_rgba(255,255,255,0.4),_0_6px_16px_rgba(0,0,0,0.3)] hover:bg-white/10\">\n                            <span class=\"text-sm font-medium tracking-wide font-geist\">Buy Ticket</span>\n                            <div class=\"bg-white/10 p-1.5 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center border border-white/10 group-hover:bg-white/20 transition-colors\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-up-linear\" class=\"text-lg group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-transform\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        // --- 1. Masked Word Reveal Animation (GSAP) ---\n        gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n        const textElements = document.querySelectorAll('.gs-reveal');\n        textElements.forEach(el => {\n            // Split text into words while preserving inner spans (basic implementation)\n            const html = el.innerHTML;\n            el.innerHTML = '';\n\n            // Temporary container to parse nodes\n            const temp = document.createElement('div');\n            temp.innerHTML = html;\n\n            Array.from(temp.childNodes).forEach(node => {\n                if (node.nodeType === 3) { // Text node\n                    const words = node.textContent.split(' ').filter(w => w.trim() !== '');\n                    words.forEach(word => {\n                        const wrapper = document.createElement('span');\n                        wrapper.className = 'reveal-wrapper';\n                        wrapper.innerHTML = `<span class=\"reveal-word\">${word}&nbsp;</span>`;\n                        el.appendChild(wrapper);\n                    });\n                } else if (node.nodeType === 1) { // Element node (like span.text-white/40)\n                    const wrapper = document.createElement('span');\n                    wrapper.className = 'reveal-wrapper ' + node.className;\n                    // Extract words from the child element\n                    const words = node.textContent.split(' ').filter(w => w.trim() !== '');\n                    let innerHTML = '';\n                    words.forEach(word => {\n                         innerHTML += `<span class=\"reveal-wrapper\"><span class=\"reveal-word\">${word}&nbsp;</span></span>`;\n                    });\n                    wrapper.innerHTML = innerHTML;\n                    // Reset original class on the wrapper to keep styling, remove from inner\n                    el.appendChild(wrapper);\n                }\n            });\n\n            // Animate\n            const words = el.querySelectorAll('.reveal-word');\n            gsap.to(words, {\n                y: '0%',\n                ease: 'power4.out',\n                duration: 1.2,\n                stagger: 0.04,\n                scrollTrigger: {\n                    trigger: el,\n                    start: 'top 85%',\n                }\n            });\n        });\n\n        // --- 2. WebGL Background Grid (Three.js) ---\n        const canvas = document.getElementById('bg-canvas');\n        const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n\n        // Deep dark atmospheric fog to hide edges\n        scene.fog = new THREE.FogExp2(0x030305, 0.04);\n\n        const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(60, window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight, 0.1, 100);\n        camera.position.set(0, 3, 8); // Elevated angle\n        camera.lookAt(0, 0, 0);\n\n        const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ canvas: canvas, alpha: true, antialias: true });\n        renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n        renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n\n        // Create Grid\n        const gridHelper = new THREE.GridHelper(40, 40, 0x1a26d9, 0xffffff);\n        // Make lines very faint\n        gridHelper.material.opacity = 0.05;\n        gridHelper.material.transparent = true;\n        scene.add(gridHelper);\n\n        // Add subtle floating particles for depth\n        const particlesGeometry = new THREE.BufferGeometry();\n        const particlesCount = 300;\n        const posArray = new Float32Array(particlesCount * 3);\n\n        for(let i = 0; i < particlesCount * 3; i++) {\n            // Spread particles across a wide area, mostly above the grid\n            posArray[i] = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 30;\n            if (i % 3 === 1) posArray[i] = Math.random() * 8; // Y axis (height)\n        }\n\n        particlesGeometry.setAttribute('position', new THREE.BufferAttribute(posArray, 3));\n        const particlesMaterial = new THREE.PointsMaterial({\n            size: 0.05,\n            color: 0xffffff,\n            transparent: true,\n            opacity: 0.3,\n            blending: THREE.AdditiveBlending\n        });\n        const particlesMesh = new THREE.Points(particlesGeometry, particlesMaterial);\n        scene.add(particlesMesh);\n\n        // Mouse Parallax\n        let mouseX = 0;\n        let mouseY = 0;\n        let targetX = 0;\n        let targetY = 0;\n        const windowHalfX = window.innerWidth / 2;\n        const windowHalfY = window.innerHeight / 2;\n\n        document.addEventListener('mousemove', (event) => {\n            mouseX = (event.clientX - windowHalfX) * 0.001;\n            mouseY = (event.clientY - windowHalfY) * 0.001;\n        });\n\n        // Animation Loop\n        const clock = new THREE.Clock();\n\n        function animate() {\n            requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n            const elapsedTime = clock.getElapsedTime();\n\n            // Smooth mouse follow\n            targetX = mouseX * 2;\n            targetY = mouseY * 1;\n\n            camera.position.x += (targetX - camera.position.x) * 0.05;\n            // Limit vertical movement\n            camera.position.y += ((targetY + 3) - camera.position.y) * 0.05;\n            camera.lookAt(0, 0, 0);\n\n            // Forward drift illusion (move grid backwards)\n            gridHelper.position.z = (elapsedTime * 0.5) % 1; // 1 is the grid cell size\n\n            // Slowly rotate particles\n            particlesMesh.rotation.y = elapsedTime * 0.02;\n\n            renderer.render(scene, camera);\n        }\n\n        animate();\n\n        // Handle Resize\n        window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n            camera.aspect = window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight;\n            camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n            renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n        });\n    </script>\n\n</body></html>", "preview_file_name": "registration-tech-summit.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/registration-tech-summit.jpg", "source_name": "registration-tech-summit-DESIGN.md", "views": 14, "forks": 2, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "5bd6211c-bd4c-467c-b442-4312cac4712c", "created_at": "2026-06-21T11:39:54.279152+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-06-30T11:53:50.706158+00:00"}